We also need to record "historical_lost" as total lost units through target_time using visible revisions. So we need to sum all lost from demands with quantity >0 that we processed. For demands with quantity 0, lost=0.

We also need to record stock_at_target: final stock after processing all chosen events sorted up to target_time. Since target_time is 100 and we included all events with event_time <=100, stock_at_target is final stock after processing all those events.

